### ⚠️ One open item before the flow can run
The IxP model we trained earlier (`vendor_invoices-3e19dd82-ixp`) **needs to be deployed to an Orchestrator folder** to appear in the flow registry. Right now the flow uses an equivalent IxP invoice model already deployed in the Shared folder. To swap in your own trained model:
1. In the IxP product, deploy `vendor_invoices-3e19dd82-ixp` to the Shared folder ([docs](https://docs.uipath.com/ixp/automation-cloud/latest/user-guide/building-and-deploying-models))
2. Run `uip maestro flow registry pull --force` to refresh
3. Search for `vendor_invoices` and swap the IxP node to point at your model

